msgid ""
"Everything in the vault is encrypted again with the new password. Backups "
"made earlier still open with the password they were made with."
msgstr ""
"Tout le contenu du coffre est de nouveau chiffré avec le nouveau mot de "
"passe. Les sauvegardes antérieures s’ouvrent toujours avec le mot de passe "
"utilisé lors de leur création."

msgid "Everything is in sync"
msgstr "Tudo em sincronia"

msgid ""
"Everything returns to how it was when the copy was made, including "
"attachments and password history. Entries created later disappear. The "
"current vault is kept in a file next to it."
msgstr ""
"Tout redevient comme au moment de la copie, y compris les pièces jointes et "
"l’historique des mots de passe. Les entrées créées ensuite disparaissent. Le "
"coffre actuel est conservé dans un fichier à côté."

msgid "Everything was already in sync"
msgstr "Tudo já estava sincronizado"

